{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38970","headline":"行次荥阳却寄诸弟 · 杜荀鹤","name":"行次荥阳却寄诸弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"难把归书说远情，奉亲多阙拙爲兄。\n早知寸禄荣家晚，悔不深山共汝耕。\n枕上算程关月落，帽前搜景岳云生。\n如今已作长安计，祗得辛勤取一名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}